  - large language models
  - multi-agent systems
  - process discovery
abstract: >-
  ProcessMind is a research framework that fuses heterogeneous process
  knowledge sources — unstructured SOP text and structured event logs —
  into valid, conformance-checked BPMN 2.0 models. It implements five
  extractor configurations (deterministic rule parser, single-shot LLM,
  LLM with self-correction, DFG discovery, and a sound-by-construction
  Inductive Miner) evaluated under one identical-measures harness.
